{"version":1,"content":"<p>選秀節目《聲秀》出身的新人甄敏芳(Jenny)，正式加入無綫處境劇《愛．回家之三代同糖》，被視為新一代宅男女神的Jenny，首次拍劇即化身女僕，雖然與穎喬（Ziva）只是客串，但表現非常搶鏡。</p><p>Jenny今次破格展現嗲聲嗲氣的一面，除了頻頻甜</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:22:18.305058+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T10:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T10:18:34.174564+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:18:34.174564+00:00","content_hash":"c63dee092e9b473766ffc1d040ebfbe36b488544061ffb70c8e636c85bf0c3ef","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}